   "subject": "Covariance between latent traits in Random intercept cross-lagged panel model",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Hello,<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">I am\r\nrunning a random-intercept cross-lagged panel model as follow:<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">riclpm&lt;-&#39;<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">#Latent\r\nmean structure with intercepts<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">#Random\r\nintercepts<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">RIL =~\r\n1*L3 + 1*L5 + 1*L11<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">RIB =~\r\n1*B3 + 1*B5 + 1*B11<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">#Intercepts<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">L3 ~ l3*1<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">L5 ~ l5*1<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">L11 ~\r\nl11*1<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">B3 ~ b3*1<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">B5 ~ b5*1<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">B11 ~\r\nb11*1<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">#Variances\r\nand covariance<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">RIL ~~ RIL\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">RIB ~~ RIB<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">RIL ~~ RIB<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">#Latent\r\nvariables for AR and cross-lagged effects<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">FL3 =~\r\n1*L3<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">FL5 =~\r\n1*L5<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">FL11 =~\r\n1*L11<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">FB3 =~\r\n1*B3<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">FB5 =~\r\n1*B5<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">FB11 =~\r\n1*B11<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"># AR and\r\ncross-lagged effects<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">FL11 ~ FL5\r\n+ FB5<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">FL5 ~ FL3\r\n+ FB3<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">FB11 ~ FL5\r\n+ FB5<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">FB5 ~ FL3\r\n+ FB3<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">#Variances\r\nand covariances<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">FL3 ~~ FL3<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">FL5 ~~ FL5<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">FL11 ~~\r\nFL11<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">FB3 ~~ FB3<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">FB5 ~~ FB5<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">FB11 ~~\r\nFB11<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">FL3 ~~ FB3<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">FL5 ~~ FB5<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">FL11 ~~\r\nFB11<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">&#39;<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">riclpm.fit\r\n&lt;- lavaan(riclpm, data = bidat,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">              missing = &#39;ML&#39;,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">              int.ov.free = F,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">              int.lv.free = F,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">              auto.fix.first = F,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">              auto.fix.single = F,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">              auto.cov.lv.x = F,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">              auto.cov.y = F,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">              auto.var = F)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">I am very\r\nsurprised with the very high covariance that I obtained between my two random\r\nintercepts: I get a RIL~~RIB estimate equal to -1.015 (Std.lv = -0.798, Std.all\r\n= -0.798). I do not understand how the covariance can be so high when the\r\ncorrelation between my measured variables L and B at each time are quite low: r(L3,B3)=-0.15;\r\nr(L5,B5)=-0.12; r(L11,B11)=-0.11. I am not sure how this is possible?<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">I tried to\r\nextract the RIL and RIB with lavPredict in order to try and understand better\r\nwhat is happening. I used the following code:<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">priclpm&lt;-lavPredict(riclpm.fit,\r\ntype=&quot;lv&quot;, method=&quot;regression&quot;, append.data=TRUE)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">dpriclpm&lt;-as.data.frame(priclpm)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">cor(dpriclpm$RIL,dpriclpm$RIB)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">cov(dpriclpm$RIL,dpriclpm$RIB)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">plot(x=dpriclpm$RIL, y=dpriclpm$RIB)<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><br></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">The\r\ncovariance between the RIL and RIB predicted by lavPredict is equal to -0.76,\r\nand the correlation is equal to -0.96. These results brought an additional\r\nquestion: I thought that the covariance between latent variables in <a href=\"http://std.lv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://std.lv&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792422985560000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2w6JheKH-O-erZRQnpG43m\">std.lv</a> and std.all\r\ncould be understood as a correlation, since the variables are standardized. But\r\nthen why don’t we observe the same value between the correlation computed by\r\nlavPredict and the std. covariance from the model?<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Thank you\r\nin advance for your insights!<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Ava</span></p></div>"
    ]
   ]
  }
 ]
}
